  "name": "Umber",
  "subtitle": "where shadows keep promises",
  "story": "On Umber, your shadow keeps your promises. Say you'll be there early, and your shadow is, lying politely on the doormat. Say you'll visit your mum more, and it does, every Sunday, while you're busy. She tells it everything. It never looks at its phone. For once, you tag along. Mum opens the door: 'Hello, stranger.'",
